    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a fixed-size stack used for undo operations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores a list of recent recipe operations.</para>
<para>Implements standard LIFO behavior for tracking recent actions. </para>
